{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/Small.png?t=1743020462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You wake up in a labyrinth of yellow-tinted hallways, illuminated by the relentless hum of fluorescent lights. You don\u2019t remember how you got here, but one thing is certain: you don\u2019t belong in this place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The silence is suffocating. The feeling of solitude is a lie. Something lurks in the shadows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Run. Escape. Survive.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/Story.png?t=1743020462\" />You are <strong>David Campbell</strong>. You remember nothing. All you know is that you\u2019re trapped in an endless maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you search for answers, a specialized organization in the Backrooms will offer help\u2026 sometimes. But this place doesn\u2019t forgive the unprepared. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll have to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1743020462\" />A A first-person horror game that combines puzzles, intense chases, and an oppressive atmosphere. Every step could be your last, and every decision will determine whether you escape or remain trapped forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/Horror.png?t=1743020462\" />We\u2019ve crafted a unique atmosphere to fully immerse you in the Backrooms. The tension never truly fades: there are moments of calm, but the feeling of being watched never disappears.</p>","achievements":{"high